  {
    "analysis": [
      "v3.23.0 的功能更新集中于 Agents 相关能力（类型化会话流返回、文件暂存与产物下载）以及 API 层（session traces、Realtime translations），显示 SDK 正在补齐智能体工作流的服务端接口与开发体验。",
      "多个 Bug Fixes 涉及 responses 重连时的重复发送与发送队列限制，以及 WebSocket 路径与查询参数保留，指向连接可靠性与断线恢复行为的持续打磨。",
      "Chores 中 WebRTC Live 会话传输类型的保留，与新增 Realtime translations 相呼应，暗示 SDK 在实时音视频会话方向有并行推进。"
    ],
    "canonical_title": "openai/openai-python 发布 v3.23.0：新增 Agents 会话流类型化返回与文件暂存等功能",
    "category": "open_source_ai",
    "credibility_score": 0.9,
    "entity_names": [
      "OpenAI"
    ],
    "facts": [
      "openai/openai-python 于 2026-10-01 发布 v3.23.0 版本（对比基线 v3.22.1）。",
      "本次发布的 Features 包括：agents: [1/n] return typed answers from session streams (#4007)；agents: stage files and download turn artifacts (#4009)；api: Add session traces and Realtime translations (#4001)；beta: expose typed application actions as agent tools (#4006)；collect final output from beta Agents streams (157ac4c)。",
      "本次发布的 Bug Fixes 包括：api: allow original image detail in Chat Completions (#4005)；api: correct the eval run cancellation endpoint (#4003)；api: retain WebSocket endpoint paths and query parameters (#3999)；keep Castiron budget results valid when main advances (#4012)；responses: avoid replaying uncertain typed sends on reconnect (#4011)；responses: respect send queue limits during reconnect (#4000)；use monotonic clock for file processing timeout (#3748)。",
      "本次发布的 Chores 包括：api: retain WebRTC Live session transport types (#4002)；deps-dev: bump pyright from 1.1.413 to 1.1.414 (#3902)；deps: bump astral-sh/setup-uv from 10.0.1 to 10.1.0 (#3976)；deps: bump CodeQL actions to 4.38.1 (#3974)。",
      "该仓库当前 star 数为 31734，fork 数为 6774，open issues 为 132。"
    ],
